## Pre-read Table

| Area | Read first |
|---|---|
| App entry and routing | `app/page.tsx`, `app/layout.tsx` |
| Map flow | `components/map/map-page-client.tsx`, `components/map/map-component.tsx` |
| Modal card flow | `components/pins/pin-card.tsx`, `components/pins/pin-form.tsx` |
| Media and pedigree | `components/pins/gallery-grid.tsx`, `components/pins/document-link.tsx`, `components/pins/pedigree-tree.tsx` |
| Domain model | `types/pin.ts`, `lib/pins.ts`, `data/mockData.json` |
| Safe embeds | `lib/video/embed.ts` |

## Domain Entities

| Entity | Source | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `PinRecord` | `types/pin.ts` | Main card + map entity |
| `PinRole` | `types/pin.ts` | One of: Заводчик, Питомник, Клуб, Хендлер, Ветеринар |
| `PinCoordinates` | `types/pin.ts` | Lat/Lng for MapLibre markers |
| `PedigreeTreeData` | `types/pin.ts` | Multi-generation pedigree structure |
| `DysplasiaDocument` | `types/pin.ts` | Document metadata for result link block |
| `GalleryImage` | `types/pin.ts` | Photo gallery item |

## Routes

| Route | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `/` | App Router page | Full-screen map and modal card shell |

## Query Params

| Param | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `pin` | Opens an existing pin card in view mode |
| `draft` | Opens create mode when value is `new` |
| `lat` | Draft latitude |
| `lng` | Draft longitude |

## API Groups

Current MVP has no backend API. All data is loaded from `data/mockData.json`.

## Environment Variables

Current MVP requires no environment variables.
